        <mxCell id="Juq6fXyGjDSmXVS3NqAy-42" parent="1" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=0.07407407407407407;rotation=-180;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="270" width="520" x="1120" y="570" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Juq6fXyGjDSmXVS3NqAy-39" parent="1" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=0.3333333333333333;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;; font-size: 10px; text-align: start; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;golden_set_profitability.csv&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="520" x="1120" y="520" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Juq6fXyGjDSmXVS3NqAy-41" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;cost_accounting&lt;/b&gt;: Cost concepts and costing systems, including cost classifications (direct, indirect, fixed, variable, mixed), cost behavior, contribution margin, job-order costing, process costing, and inventory cost flows&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;cvp_analysis&lt;/b&gt;: Cost-Volume-Profit (CVP) analysis, contribution margin, break-even analysis, target profit, operating leverage, and the impact of sales volume on profitability&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;budgeting&lt;/b&gt;: Budget planning and control, including master budgets, sales and production budgets, flexible budgeting, and budget variance reporting&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;variance_analysis&lt;/b&gt;: Standard costing and variance analysis, including material, labor, and overhead variances, interpretation, and performance monitoring&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;performance_evaluation&lt;/b&gt;: Responsibility accounting, responsibility centers, ROI, residual income, decentralized organizations, and performance measurement&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;decision_analysis&lt;/b&gt;: Differential and relevant cost analysis for managerial decision-making, including make-or-buy, add-or-drop, special orders, outsourcing, and sell-or-process-further decisions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;capital_budgeting&lt;/b&gt;: Long-term investment appraisal using payback period, simple rate of return, time value of money, net present value (NPV), internal rate of return (IRR), and capital investment evaluation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="530" x="1100" y="570" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Juq6fXyGjDSmXVS3NqAy-43" parent="1" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=0.07407407407407407;rotation=-180;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="270" width="410" x="680" y="570" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Juq6fXyGjDSmXVS3NqAy-44" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#14181f&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;problem_structuring&lt;/b&gt;: Structured problem-solving approaches including MECE, issue trees, profitability trees, and business frameworks (e.g., Porter&#39;s Five Forces, 3Cs, 4Ps)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#14181f&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;hypothesis_driven&lt;/b&gt;: Forming, prioritizing, testing, and refining hypotheses to guide the analysis and decision-making process&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#14181f&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;quantitative_analysis&lt;/b&gt;: Quantitative problem solving including market sizing, break-even analysis, profitability calculations, percentages, and financial reasoning&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#14181f&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;communication&lt;/b&gt;: Top-down communication using the Pyramid Principle, synthesizing findings, explaining assumptions, and executive-style communication&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#14181f&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;recommendation&lt;/b&gt;: Developing clear, evidence-based recommendations, including supporting rationale, risks, limitations, and next steps&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="430" x="660" y="580" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
